sequenceDiagram
    actor Usuario as Usuário
    participant CLI as index.js
    participant Reporter as CidadesTXTReporter
    participant FS as node:fs

    Usuario->>CLI: node index.js [filename] txt
    
    CLI->>Reporter: new CidadesTXTReporter()
    
    CLI->>Reporter: ler('./data/cidades-2.json')
    Reporter->>FS: readFileSync('./data/cidades-2.json')
    FS-->>Reporter: retorna string do arquivo
    
    CLI->>Reporter: parse()
    Reporter->>Reporter: JSON.parse(this.cidades)
    
    CLI->>Reporter: reportar()
    Reporter-->>CLI: retorna string em texto puro (TXT)
    
    CLI-->>Usuario: imprime no console (console.log)